        "usage": "The neutral every hover, press and current mix takes in, so state grounds shift the surface underneath without leaving its family. In light, a dark warm neutral from the ground's own hue, so states blend into the warm ground instead of greying it; ink in dark."
      },
      {
        "name": "on-ink",
        "value": {
